 "tags": [
  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Cloud Filestore API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Instances, snapshots and backups are configuration metadata: no NFS server, file share, network address or file data exists, and every resource reports READY immediately. A backup must name an existing instance as sourceInstance but captures no data; restore, revert and replica methods remain unimplemented, and file shares restored from backups, replication and tag bindings are refused. Long-running operations complete synchronously. Deletion protection blocks delete, and an instance with snapshots is deleted only with force=true.",
   "name": "Filestore"
  }
 ],
